              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Hezekiya ahamvya ba sekuruza, bamuhamba ku gasozi ahari itongo bahambamwo abo mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi. Amaze gupfa, Abayuda bose n’ab’i Yerusalemu bamuha icubahiro. Maze Manase umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
